      "width": 370.44,
      "height": 157.5,
      "text": "✅ M0  Tooling & squelette (Docker, Spring, Vite)\n✅ M1  Hello world full-stack (GET /api/ping)\n✅ Infra  Docker dev / prod (make dev · make prod)\n⏳ M2  Novel + Flyway + seed\n◻️ M3  Bibliothèque (grille React)\n◻️ M4  Relations & détail (chapter, genre)\n◻️ M5  Lecteur (lire, préc./suiv.)\n◻️ M6  Progression (sauver / reprendre)\n◻️ M7  Polish (recherche, validation, tests)",
      "originalText": "✅ M0  Tooling & squelette (Docker, Spring, Vite)\n✅ M1  Hello world full-stack (GET /api/ping)\n✅ Infra  Docker dev / prod (make dev · make prod)\n⏳ M2  Novel + Flyway + seed\n◻️ M3  Bibliothèque (grille React)\n◻️ M4  Relations & détail (chapter, genre)\n◻️ M5  Lecteur (lire, préc./suiv.)\n◻️ M6  Progression (sauver / reprendre)\n◻️ M7  Polish (recherche, validation, tests)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
